    "text": "<p>The solid cylinder of length <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>80</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math> and mass <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>M</mi></math> has a radius of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>20</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi><mo>.</mo></math> Calculate the density of the material used if the moment of inertia of the cylinder about an axis <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></math> parallel to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></math> as shown in figure is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></math>.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/13a668ec-f60a-4549-b8f1-66da20be28b9-image.png\" style=\"width: 292px; height: 265px;\" /></p>",
